  $$Rizky Pratama Wibowo is an agricultural finance analyst based in Jakarta with seven years of experience in financial inclusion for smallholder farmers in Indonesia and the Philippines. He has run market research for rural banks and microfinance institutions, combining demand-side surveys of farm households with interviews of lenders, input suppliers and aggregators in coffee, maize and seaweed value chains. He designs survey instruments, cleans and analyses the data in R, and turns the results into product recommendations such as seasonal loans and value-chain finance through off-takers. Recent work includes a gender analysis of women farmers' access to credit and a review of digital financial services used by cooperatives in Nusa Tenggara. He also studies crop insurance uptake and tests simple message designs with farmers.$$,
