INSERT INTO video_responses (id, profile_id, kind, question_id, video_url, video_path, transcript, duration_seconds) VALUES
  ('b5131a08-862f-56f7-9c55-9d76721c0454', '25817ced-5288-5fe9-8eb1-463c136bf4ac', 'question', (SELECT id FROM interview_questions WHERE sort_order = 1 AND active ORDER BY id LIMIT 1), NULL, $$demo/qna-1.mp4$$, $$[Demo answer] The project I am proudest of is Côte d'Ivoire's e-procurement roll-out. My role was head of the unit that wrote the requirements, managed the vendor and trained officers. What changed is that tenders moved online in every central ministry, and the tender cycle fell by almost half.$$, 20),
  ('c5ab143f-a990-511a-9052-267362cf9e98', '25817ced-5288-5fe9-8eb1-463c136bf4ac', 'question', (SELECT id FROM interview_questions WHERE sort_order = 2 AND active ORDER BY id LIMIT 1), NULL, $$demo/qna-2.mp4$$, $$[Demo answer] When I started in Togo I knew the rules but not the people. I spent the first week with procurement officers, not managers, watching how a tender actually moves on paper. That told me more than the legal review.$$, 20),
  ('b391910e-5320-5153-96bb-ac1a18862a59', '25817ced-5288-5fe9-8eb1-463c136bf4ac', 'question', (SELECT id FROM interview_questions WHERE sort_order = 3 AND active ORDER BY id LIMIT 1), NULL, $$demo/qna-3.mp4$$, $$[Demo answer] In Senegal we had to tell the funder that the data publication would slip by three months. I came with the reason, a revised plan and one thing we could publish immediately, so the conversation stayed on solutions.$$, 20),
  ('df79bbc8-aadd-5e8f-b3a2-b8b1176af031', '25817ced-5288-5fe9-8eb1-463c136bf4ac', 'question', (SELECT id FROM interview_questions WHERE sort_order = 4 AND active ORDER BY id LIMIT 1), NULL, $$demo/qna-4.mp4$$, $$[Demo answer] Most of my work is with national teams who know their system better than I do. I make sure national trainers deliver the training, not me, and I write materials in French first and translate after.$$, 20),
  ('27fa9532-42cb-507c-a6fe-a54590852220', '25817ced-5288-5fe9-8eb1-463c136bf4ac', 'question', (SELECT id FROM interview_questions WHERE sort_order = 5 AND active ORDER BY id LIMIT 1), NULL, $$demo/qna-5.mp4$$, $$[Demo answer] I specialise in MAPS assessments for e-procurement. They are not the right tool when a government has already decided to buy a platform; then you need a requirements process, not a diagnosis.$$, 20);
